abstract: "Autonomous Agent Skill and Python crystallographic workbench driving GSAS-II (GSASIIscriptable) for powder X-ray diffraction pre-inspection, analytical search-match phase identification, isostructural analog generation, Stage-Gate Rietveld and Pawley whole-pattern refinement, residual diagnostics, and crystallochemical validation (Bond Valence Sum, Global Instability Index)."
